{{!< default}}

<section class="hero">
    <div class="shell hero-grid">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">开源软件 · 学习笔记 · 工程实践</p>
            <h1>把复杂技术，写成可以重现的答案。</h1>
            <p class="hero-copy">{{@site.description}}</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a class="button" href="#latest">开始阅读</a>
                <button class="button button-quiet" type="button" data-ghost-search>搜索全站</button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <aside class="hero-note" aria-label="博客说明">
            <span class="note-index">01</span>
            <p>这里记录从问题、实验到结论的完整路径。每篇文章都标明标签和预估阅读时间。</p>
        </aside>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="latest" class="section shell">
    <div class="section-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">LATEST NOTES</p><h2>最新文章</h2></div>
        <p>从代码、工具到复盘，保留每一次可追溯的学习记录。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="post-grid">
        {{#foreach posts}}
            {{> "post-card"}}
        {{else}}
            <div class="empty-state">
                <h3>还没有发布文章</h3>
                <p>请在 Ghost 管理端导入演示数据或发布第一篇文章。</p>
            </div>
        {{/foreach}}
    </div>
    {{pagination}}
</section>

